; DOMAIN: formal/computer-science+meta-mathematics [SYNTHESIS, derived 2026-08-04]; Bridge: genesis_computational_complexity × synthesis_meta_obstruction. The three P vs NP barriers (relativization, natural proofs, algebrization) form an obstruction ladder. By the Lawvere fixed-point contrapositive (meta-obstruction theorem), this ladder has no top — no meta-barrier can provably classify ALL barriers, because such a meta-barrier must classify itself, triggering self-reference contradiction.;; Barrier 1: Relativization (Baker-Gill-Solovay 1975)(|- ((--> RelativizationBarrier ObstructionTo PureDiagonalization) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (&& (--> Proof $proof (Relativizes $proof)) (--> OracleExists $A (== (P^ $A) (NP^ $A))) (--> OracleExists $B (!= (P^ $B) (NP^ $B)))) (--> CannotSettle $proof PvsNP)) (stv 1.0 0.9)));; Barrier 2: Natural Proofs (Razborov-Rudich 1994)(|- ((--> NaturalProofsBarrier ObstructionTo CombinatorialCircuitLowerBounds) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (&& (--> NaturalProperty $P (Constructible $P)) (--> NaturalProperty $P (Large $P)) (--> NaturalProperty $P (Useful $P)) (--> PseudorandomGeneratorsExist)) (--> Breaks $P PseudorandomGenerators)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (&& (--> PseudorandomGeneratorsExist) (--> Breaks $P PseudorandomGenerators) (--> NaturalProperty $P (Distinguishes HardFunction EasyFunction))) (--> NoNaturalPropertyCanDistinguish)) (stv 1.0 0.9)));; Barrier 3: Algebrization (Aaronson-Wigderson 2008)(|- ((--> AlgebrizationBarrier ObstructionTo (DiagonalizationPlus AlgebraicStructure)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (&& (--> AlgebraicOracleExtension $Aprime (Exists $Aprime (== (P^ $Aprime) (NP^ $Aprime)))) (--> AlgebraicOracleExtension $Bprime (Exists $Bprime (!= (P^ $Bprime) (NP^ $Bprime))))) (--> CannotSettle $proof PvsNP)) (stv 1.0 0.9)));; The barrier ladder: each barrier classifies what previous barriers missed(|- ((--> BarrierLadder RelativizationBarrier Level0) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((--> BarrierLadder NaturalProofsBarrier Level1) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((--> BarrierLadder AlgebrizationBarrier Level2) (stv 1.0 0.9)));; Each barrier is an obstruction in the meta-obstruction sense(|- ((==> (--> Barrier $B) (--> Obstruction $B (WhatCannotWork $B))) (stv 1.0 0.9)));; KEY SYNTHESIS: The barrier ladder has no top — Lawvere fixed-point contrapositive applied to barrier taxonomy(|- ((==> (&& (--> CompleteBarrierTaxonomy $T) (--> Classifies $T AllBarriers) (--> Diagonalize (SelfReference $T) (MetaBarrier $T))) (--> Contradiction $T)) (stv 1.0 0.9)));; No meta-barrier can classify all barriers, because it must classify itself(|- ((==> (&& (--> NotComplete $T) (--> MetaBarrier $T (UnclassifiableBy $T)) (--> LawvereContrapositive (BarrierTaxonomy $T))) (--> IncompletenessOfBarrierTaxonomy $T)) (stv 1.0 0.9)));; The incompleteness is meta-theoretic, not object-level: P vs NP has a definite answer, but no finite barrier taxonomy can be proven exhaustive(|- ((==> (&& (--> DefiniteAnswer PvsNP) (--> IncompletenessOfBarrierTaxonomy $T)) (--> MetaTheoreticIncompleteness NotObjectLevelUndecidability)) (stv 1.0 0.9)));; Falsifiability: if a proof technique escapes all barriers AND is immune to meta-obstruction, this synthesis is refuted(|- ((==> (&& (--> EscapesAllBarriers $technique) (--> ImmuneToMetaObstruction $technique)) (--> RefutesThisSynthesis)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (&& (--> LawvereContrapositive (BarrierTaxonomy $T)) (--> MetaObstructionApplies $technique)) (--> Not (ImmuneToMetaObstruction $technique))) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(;; FORMAL PATCH: Lawvere fixed-point contrapositive formal structure)(;; A = proof techniques, B = barrier properties, g = fixpoint-free endomap)(|- ((--> ProofTechniqueSpace A) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((--> BarrierPropertySpace B) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((--> CartesianClosed CategoryOfProofTechniques) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((--> ExponentialObject B^A CategoryOfProofTechniques) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(;; Taxonomy classifier T: A -> B^A)(|- ((--> TaxonomyClassifier T A B^A) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(;; Point-surjectivity: every map A->B realized by some proof technique)(|- ((==> (--> PointSurjective T) (forall $f (--> Exists $a (== (T $a) $f)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))))(;; Fixpoint-free endomap g: B -> B)(|- ((--> FixpointFreeEndomap g B B) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (--> FixpointFree g) (forall $b (!= (g $b) $b) (stv 1.0 0.9)))))(;; Why g is fixpoint-free: if g(b)=b, barrier escapes itself but classifies itself — contradiction)(|- ((==> (== (g $b) $b) (&& (--> Escapes $b $b) (--> Classifies $b $b)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (&& (--> Escapes $b $b) (--> Classifies $b $b)) (--> Contradiction $b)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(;; LAWVERE CONTRAPOSITIVE: if g fixpoint-free, no point-surjective T exists)(|- ((==> (&& (--> FixpointFree g) (--> PointSurjective T)) (--> Contradiction LawvereApplication)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (--> FixpointFree g) (--> Not (PointSurjective T))) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(;; CONCLUSION: no complete barrier taxonomy can be point-surjective)(|- ((==> (--> Not (PointSurjective T)) (--> IncompleteTaxonomy T)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (--> IncompleteTaxonomy T) (--> NoCompleteBarrierClassification)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(;; FALSIFIABILITY: refuted if technique escapes all barriers AND self-classifies without contradiction)(|- ((==> (&& (--> EscapesAllKnownBarriers $technique) (--> SelfClassifiesWithoutContradiction $technique)) (--> RefutesThisSynthesis)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (--> LawvereContrapositive (BarrierTaxonomy T)) (--> Not (ImmuneToMetaObstruction $technique))) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(;; REFINEMENT RELATIONS: obstruction ladder as structural refinement chain)(;; Natural proofs targets techniques escaping relativization)(|- ((==> (&& (--> Escapes $technique RelativizationBarrier) (--> CombinatorialTechnique $technique)) (--> TargetedBy NaturalProofsBarrier $technique)) (stv 0.85 0.85)))(;; Algebrization targets techniques escaping both relativization and natural proofs)(|- ((==> (&& (--> Escapes $technique RelativizationBarrier) (--> Escapes $technique NaturalProofsBarrier) (--> AlgebraicOracleExtension $technique)) (--> TargetedBy AlgebrizationBarrier $technique)) (stv 0.85 0.85)))(|- ((--> StrictRefinement RelativizationBarrier NaturalProofsBarrier) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((--> StrictRefinement NaturalProofsBarrier AlgebrizationBarrier) (stv 1.0 0.9)))(|- ((==> (&& (--> StrictRefinement RelativizationBarrier NaturalProofsBarrier) (--> StrictRefinement NaturalProofsBarrier AlgebrizationBarrier)) (--> BarrierLadderIsStructuralRefinement)) (stv 1.0 0.9)))
